{{!
    @template format_aicourse/report_index

    The AI Tutor report index: one card per course using this course format, with its AI tutor
    totals and a link to the per-course report.

    Classes required for JS:
    * None.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None.

    index.php uses pagelayout `admin`, so this markup never carries the format-aicourse body
    class. Its styling hangs off the plugin-owned .aitutor-report-index root, which carries the
    plugin's design tokens for exactly that reason (styles.css sections 2-5 and 21c).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title string Page heading, from the language pack. It is NOT printed here: Moodle's page
      header already emits it as the page <h1>, so each course card title is an <h2> directly under
      it and no level is skipped.
    * hascourses bool True when at least one course uses this format.
    * courses array One entry per course.
      * fullname string Course full name, already filtered by format_string() but NOT escaped, so
        it is rendered with a double mustache.
      * shortname string Course short name, same handling as fullname.
      * reporturl string URL of the per-course report.
      * stats array Three counters, each with value (string) and label (string).
    * emptytitle string Heading of the empty state.
    * emptydesc string Body of the empty state.
    * viewlabel string Label of the per-course report link.
    * adminreporturl string URL of the site-wide report.
    * adminreportlabel string Label of the site-wide report link.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "AI Tutor Report",
        "hascourses": true,
        "courses": [
            {
                "fullname": "Introduction to Astrophysics",
                "shortname": "ASTRO101",
                "reporturl": "https://example.org/course/format/aicourse/report.php?id=2",
                "stats": [
                    {"value": "12", "label": "Total Questions"},
                    {"value": "7", "label": "Marked Helpful"},
                    {"value": "1", "label": "Corrected Responses"}
                ]
            }
        ],
        "emptytitle": "No courses using AI Course Format",
        "emptydesc": "Change a course format to AI Course Format to enable the AI Tutor.",
        "viewlabel": "View Report",
        "adminreporturl": "https://example.org/course/format/aicourse/admin_report.php",
        "adminreportlabel": "View all AI Tutor Q&A"
    }
}}
<div class="aitutor-report-index">
    <div class="aitutor-report-header">
        <a href="{{adminreporturl}}" class="aitutor-course-btn btn btn-outline-primary">
            {{adminreportlabel}}
        </a>
    </div>

    {{#hascourses}}
    <div class="aitutor-course-grid">
        {{#courses}}
        <div class="aitutor-course-card">
            <h2>{{fullname}}</h2>
            <p>{{shortname}}</p>
            <div class="aitutor-course-stats">
                {{#stats}}
                <div class="aitutor-course-stat">
                    <div class="aitutor-course-stat-value">{{value}}</div>
                    <div class="aitutor-course-stat-label">{{label}}</div>
                </div>
                {{/stats}}
            </div>
            <a href="{{reporturl}}" class="aitutor-course-btn btn btn-primary">{{viewlabel}}</a>
        </div>
        {{/courses}}
    </div>
    {{/hascourses}}
    {{^hascourses}}
    <div class="aitutor-empty-state">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"/>
        </svg>
        <h2>{{emptytitle}}</h2>
        <p>{{emptydesc}}</p>
    </div>
    {{/hascourses}}
</div>
